WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.990
White Leaf's Germicidal and Therapy Lights are used in the calving area.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.230
Our lights help the cow prepare for birthing, and in those first hours after birth,

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:13.150
the cow and her newborn calf need a safer, healthier environment.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.910
Red light penetrates deep, through the hide and skin,

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.350
and even into the eyes.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:23.010
Inside the body, it boosts cellular energy, called ATP,

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.730
and stimulates collagen.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.710
It helps the cow before, during and after calving —

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:33.710
healing tissue, reducing pain and inflammation, supporting joints and muscles,

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.930
and improving circulation — while supporting the newborn calf's immune health in those

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.810
critical first hours of life.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.450
White Leaf Technology Group.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.951
Visit whiteleafled.com.
